+// Inline glossary term with a tooltip that works on touch as well as hover.
 // Usage in MDX: <Term id="actuator">actuator</Term>
 // Definitions live in /public/glossary.json — one source of truth.
+//
+// Previously this was a hover-only CSS ::after, which meant the definition
